<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Newcrest year net profit A$20.81 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Newcrest year net profit A$20.81 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    27.13 vs 104.87</p>
<p>    Net				     20.81 vs  66.23</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    12.5  vs  18.75</p>
